<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Architecture Office Automation in Romania | ArchLab</title><meta name="description" content="Office-specific Revit and Archicad workflow setup for small Romanian architecture practices. Explore the pilot, €150 audit, €1,000 setup and ongoing care."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://archlab.pro/office-automation"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content="Your office standards. Less repetitive work. | ArchLab"/><meta property="og:description" content="Explore the ArchLab Office Automation pilot for architecture practices in Oradea and Arad."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://archlab.pro/office-automation"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://archlab.pro/brand-2026/assets/project-sketch.webp"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><link rel="icon" href="/brand-2026/assets/logo.svg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand-2026/hero.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand-2026/office.css"/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)}/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand-2026/identity.css?v=3"/><script is:inline defer src="/brand-2026/motion.js"></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#content">Skip to content</a><header class="identity-nav"><a href="/" class="identity-brand" aria-label="ArchLab home"><img src="/brand-2026/assets/logo.svg" alt="" width="34" height="34"><span>ArchLab</span></a><span class="sheet-code" data-sheet>A-101 / STUDIO</span><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/sketch-to-render">Renders</a><a href="/office-automation">Office Automation</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></nav><a class="nav-signin" href="https://client.archlab.pro/login">Sign in ↗</a><details class="identity-menu"><summary>Menu</summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/sketch-to-render">Renders</a><a href="/office-automation">Office Automation</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="https://client.archlab.pro/login">Sign in ↗</a></nav></details></header><main id="content">
<section class="office-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">ARCHLAB OFFICE AUTOMATION · PILOT PROGRAMME</p><h1>Your office standards.<br/><em>Less repetitive work.</em></h1><p class="lead">AI workflow setup for architecture practices that want their tools to work the way their office works.</p><p>We turn your templates, naming rules and documentation habits into practical workflows for Claude, Revit or Archicad—with ArchLab for concept renders.</p><a class="primary" href="mailto:support@archlab.pro?subject=Office%20Automation%20audit">Discuss an automation audit <span>↗</span></a><p class="small">For teams of 1–19. Starting in Oradea and Arad, Romania.<br/>Pilot delivery and software compatibility confirmed during the audit.</p></div><aside class="desk" aria-label="Illustrative office workflow"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND YOUR PRACTICE</p><div class="sheet"><span>01 / YOUR STANDARDS</span><h2>The way<br/><em>you work.</em></h2><ul><li>Your templates &amp; title blocks</li><li>Your naming &amp; sheet layouts</li><li>Your review checklists</li></ul></div><div class="recipe">Office profile → Agreed workflow → Architect review</div><p class="small">Illustrative process · not a product screenshot</p></aside></section>
<section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">A SERVICE, CONFIGURED FOR YOUR OFFICE</p><h2>Keep your methods.<br/><em>Make them repeatable.</em></h2><div class="three"><article><h3>Your standards, made usable</h3><p>We translate your office documents into short workflow instructions that refer to your own files and conventions.</p></article><article><h3>Tested against familiar work</h3><p>We use a finished project to compare the configured workflow with drawings your team already knows.</p></article><article><h3>Your team stays in control</h3><p>Training covers how to ask, how to review and when not to use automation. The architect remains responsible for the output.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="workflows"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORKFLOW MENU</p><h2>Start with checks.<br/><em>Build toward documentation.</em></h2><p>These are the planned workflow options. The audit establishes which are compatible and ready for your pilot; model-changing workflows follow the read-only checks.</p><div class="workflow-grid"><article><span>01 · READ-ONLY</span><h3>Model check</h3><p>Review warnings, naming errors, unplaced rooms and unused views before issue.</p></article><article><span>02 · READ-ONLY</span><h3>Area tables</h3><p>Prepare Su, Sc and Scd tables in your format and support POT/CUT checks against the CU.</p></article><article><span>03 · READ-ONLY</span><h3>Permit completeness</h3><p>Review the DTAC set for missing drawings, incorrect scales and empty title-block fields.</p></article><article><span>04 · ARCHLAB</span><h3>Concept renders</h3><p>Explore materials, mood and time of day using agreed office style presets.</p></article><article><span>05 · MODEL COPY</span><h3>Site study</h3><p>Extract CU constraints for review, prepare a site board and explore a buildable-envelope massing.</p></article><article><span>06 · MODEL COPY</span><h3>Documentation set</h3><p>Configure sheets, views, scales, naming, tags and title blocks to your office standard.</p></article></div><p class="small">DTAC: documentation for a construction authorisation. CU: certificat de urbanism. POT and CUT: site coverage and floor-area indicators. Outputs support professional review; they do not certify compliance or guarantee a permit.</p></section>
<section class="section" id="fees"><p class="eyebrow">CLEAR SCOPE. VISIBLE COSTS.</p><h2>A setup fee.<br/><em>A plan for ongoing use.</em></h2><p>Service prices below are in EUR and exclude VAT. Software licences and per-user subscriptions are separate.</p><div class="three pricing"><article><span>01 / START HERE</span><h3>Automation audit</h3><strong class="price">€150</strong><p>One-off · 90-minute visit</p><ul><li>Review time sinks, software and workflows</li><li>Claude plan and connector assessment</li><li>One-page report within 48 hours</li></ul><p class="small">Fully credited toward setup when you sign within 30 days.</p></article><article><span>02 / YOUR OFFICE SETUP</span><h3>Office Setup</h3><strong class="price">€1,000</strong><p>One-off · agreed pilot scope</p><ul><li>Office profile and three workflows</li><li>Installation on up to five computers</li><li>Testing on a past project</li><li>Half-day training and 30 days of fixes</li></ul><p class="small">Planned mix: concept renders, site study and one additional workflow. Final mix depends on readiness and compatibility.</p></article><article><span>03 / OPTIONAL SUPPORT</span><h3>Office care</h3><strong class="price">€49</strong><p>Per office / month</p><ul><li>Fixes following supported software updates</li><li>Up to one hour of changes per month</li><li>Reply within one working day</li></ul><p class="small">Without care: €35/hour for changes, one-hour minimum.</p></article></div><div class="note"><h3>Subscriptions and additional work</h3><p>Each workflow user needs an active ArchLab plan. The proposed Romania rates are Starter €19, Pro €49 and Studio €99 per user/month; euro billing remains to be confirmed. These are distinct from the <a href="/pricing">current USD rendering plans</a>.</p><p>Your office pays Anthropic for Claude and maintains its own Revit or Archicad licences. An extra configured workflow is €300–€500, depending on scope and available templates.</p></div><div class="pilot"><div><p class="eyebrow">THREE FOUNDING PILOT OFFICES</p><h3>Build the first version with us.</h3><p>Free audit + €500 setup for the first three selected offices, in exchange for a measured case study, testimonial and two feedback sessions. Availability is confirmed when you enquire.</p></div><a class="primary" href="mailto:support@archlab.pro?subject=Office%20Automation%20pilot">Enquire about the pilot ↗</a></div><p class="small">A separate 12-month commitment option offers €200 off the standard setup. Whether discounts can be combined must be confirmed in your quote.</p></section>
<section class="section" id="process"><p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST VISIT TO FIRST WORKFLOW</p><h2>A considered setup.<br/><em>About two weeks.</em></h2><p>Indicative onboarding timing, subject to access, compatibility and agreed scope.</p><ol class="process"><li><h3>Audit &amp; agree</h3><p>Identify repetitive work, inspect software versions and choose a realistic pilot scope.</p></li><li><h3>Collect &amp; configure</h3><p>Review templates, title blocks, naming rules and a finished project. Build the office profile.</p></li><li><h3>Install &amp; test</h3><p>Connect the tools and compare workflow results against the past project. Model changes use a copy and require approval.</p></li><li><h3>Train &amp; support</h3><p>Half-day team training, then 30 days of fixes. Continue with optional care or request changes as needed.</p></li></ol></section>
<section class="section" id="questions"><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL QUESTIONS</p><h2>Before we begin.</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Who is ArchLab Office Automation for?</summary><p>The pilot is intended for Romanian architecture offices with 1–19 people, starting in Oradea and Arad, that want repeatable workflows based on their own templates and standards.</p></details><details><summary>Does it work with my Revit or Archicad version?</summary><p>The audit checks your software version, licence and available connector before a scope is agreed. Compatibility and the workflows that can be delivered are confirmed for your office; support for every version is not assumed.</p></details><details><summary>What is included in the office setup?</summary><p>The proposed €1,000 setup covers an office profile, three agreed workflows, installation on up to five computers, testing against a past project, half-day training and 30 days of fixes. The planned mix is concept renders, a site study and one additional workflow, subject to pilot readiness and compatibility.</p></details><details><summary>Are Claude and BIM software licences included?</summary><p>No. Your office pays for its own Claude plans and Revit or Archicad licences. Each person using the office workflows also needs an active ArchLab plan. The proposed Romanian subscription pricing is €19–€99 per user per month; euro billing is still to be confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Does the service replace the architect?</summary><p>No. This is software configuration and workflow support, not an architectural design or signing service. The architect reviews every output and remains responsible for drawings. Workflows that change a model are planned to run on a copy after approval.</p></details><details><summary>What happens to our templates and data?</summary><p>The planned setup keeps your templates on your computers and stores workflow instructions and file references in an ArchLab office profile. The audit and agreement must define access, connector data flows and processing terms before confidential projects are used.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after the first 30 days?</summary><p>The optional care plan is €49 per office per month, with update-related fixes, up to one hour of changes each month and a reply within one working day. Without care, changes are €35 per hour with a one-hour minimum. A reply time is not a resolution guarantee.</p></details><details><summary>How does the pilot offer work?</summary><p>The offer is for the first three selected pilot offices: a free audit and €500 setup, in exchange for a measured case study, a testimonial and two feedback sessions. Availability and scope are confirmed before booking.</p></details></div></section><section class="closing"><h2>Bring the task<br/><em>you repeat every week.</em></h2><p>Tell us your team size, city, software version and the task that takes too much time. Please do not send confidential project files in your first enquiry.</p><a class="primary" href="mailto:support@archlab.pro?subject=Office%20Automation%20enquiry">Talk to ArchLab ↗</a><p class="small">support@archlab.pro</p></section></main><footer><Brand/><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a></nav><span>© 2026 ArchLab AI S.R.L.</span></footer></body></html>
